  "sourceEntries": {
    "2847612": "<entry>\n<ent_seq>2847612</ent_seq>\n<r_ele>\n<reb>あれ</reb>\n</r_ele>\n<r_ele>\n<reb>あれっ</reb>\n</r_ele>\n<r_ele>\n<reb>あれえ</reb>\n</r_ele>\n<r_ele>\n<reb>あれー</reb>\n</r_ele>\n<r_ele>\n<reb>あり</reb>\n<re_inf>&rk;</re_inf>\n</r_ele>\n<sense>\n<pos>&int;</pos>\n<s_inf>indicates surprise, suspicion, etc.</s_inf>\n<gloss>huh?</gloss>\n<gloss>eh?</gloss>\n<gloss>what?</gloss>\n<gloss>oh</gloss>\n<gloss>hey!</gloss>\n<gloss>look!</gloss>\n<gloss>listen!</gloss>\n</sense>\n<sense>\n<stagr>あれえ</stagr>\n<stagr>あれー</stagr>\n<pos>&int;</pos>\n<misc>&fem;</misc>\n<gloss>help!</gloss>\n</sense>\n</entry>",
    "1000580": "<entry>\n<ent_seq>1000580</ent_seq>\n<k_ele>\n<keb>彼</keb>\n<ke_inf>&rK;</ke_inf>\n</k_ele>\n<k_ele>\n<keb>彼れ</keb>\n<ke_inf>&rK;</ke_inf>\n</k_ele>\n<r_ele>\n<reb>あれ</reb>\n<re_pri>ichi1</re_pri>\n</r_ele>\n<r_ele>\n<reb>アレ</reb>\n<re_inf>&sk;</re_inf>\n</r_ele>\n<sense>\n<pos>&pn;</pos>\n<xref>これ・1</xref>\n<xref>それ・1</xref>\n<xref>どれ・1</xref>\n<misc>&uk;</misc>\n<s_inf>indicating something distant from both speaker and listener (in space, time or psychologically), or something understood without naming it directly</s_inf>\n<gloss>that</gloss>\n<gloss>that thing</gloss>\n</sense>\n<sense>\n<pos>&pn;</pos>\n<misc>&uk;</misc>\n<s_inf>used to refer to one's equals or inferiors</s_inf>\n<gloss>that person</gloss>\n</sense>\n<sense>\n<pos>&pn;</pos>\n<misc>&uk;</misc>\n<gloss>then</gloss>\n<gloss>that time</gloss>\n</sense>\n<sense>\n<pos>&pn;</pos>\n<misc>&uk;</misc>\n<gloss>that place (over there)</gloss>\n</sense>\n<sense>\n<pos>&n;</pos>\n<misc>&col;</misc>\n<misc>&euph;</misc>\n<misc>&uk;</misc>\n<s_inf>oft. written as アレ</s_inf>\n<gloss>down there (i.e. one's genitals)</gloss>\n</sense>\n<sense>\n<pos>&n;</pos>\n<misc>&col;</misc>\n<misc>&euph;</misc>\n<misc>&uk;</misc>\n<s_inf>oft. written as アレ</s_inf>\n<gloss>period</gloss>\n<gloss>menses</gloss>\n</sense>\n</entry>",
    "2216120": "<entry>\n<ent_seq>2216120</ent_seq>\n<r_ele>\n<reb>これ</reb>\n</r_ele>\n<sense>\n<pos>&int;</pos>\n<s_inf>used to get the attention of one's equals or inferiors</s_inf>\n<gloss>hey</gloss>\n<gloss>oi</gloss>\n<gloss>come on</gloss>\n<gloss>look</gloss>\n<gloss>listen</gloss>\n</sense>\n</entry>",
